{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5011453","formula":"C₄₂H₅₉N₅O₁₁","hill":"C42H59N5O11","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":42.0,"H":59.0,"N":5.0,"O":11.0},"names":{"en":"CI-988"},"descriptions":{"en":"CI-988 (PD-134,308) is a drug which acts as a cholecystokinin antagonist, selective for the CCKB subtype. In animal studies it showed anxiolytic effects and potentiated the analgesic action of both morphine and endogenous opioid peptides, as well as preventing the development of tolerance to opioids and reducing symptoms of withdrawal. Consequently, it was hoped that it might have clinical applications for the treatment of pain and anxiety in humans, but trial results were disappointing with only minimal therapeutic effects observed even at high doses."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":108186,"mass":809.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@](CC1=CNC2=CC=CC=C21)(C(=O)NC[C@@H](C3=CC=CC=C3)NC(=O)CCC(=O)O)NC(=O)OC4C5CC6CC(C5)CC4C6.CNC[C@@H]([C@H]([C@@H]([C@@H](CO)O)O)O)O","inchikey":"DEZUAGYSLSZLFO-DRGCLBCYSA-N","iupac":"4-[[(1R)-2-[[(2R)-2-(2-adamantyloxycarbonylamino)-3-(1H-indol-3-yl)-2-methylpropanoyl]amino]-1-phenylethyl]amino]-4-oxobutanoic acid;(2R,3R,4R,5S)-6-(methylamino)hexane-1,2,3,4,5-pentol","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"108186","atoms":117,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.401,"y":0.474,"z":1.753,"el":"C"},{"x":0.834,"y":0.112,"z":0.373,"el":"C"},{"x":1.135,"y":-1.372,"z":0.014,"el":"C"},{"x":0.654,"y":-2.4,"z":0.994,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.633,"y":-2.89,"z":1.101,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.666,"y":-3.801,"z":2.121,"el":"N"},{"x":0.585,"y":-3.943,"z":2.672,"el":"C"},{"x":1.019,"y":-4.763,"z":3.721,"el":"C"},{"x":2.369,"y":-4.699,"z":4.078,"el":"C"},{"x":3.246,"y":-3.847,"z":3.413,"el":"C"},{"x":2.795,"y":-3.033,"z":2.367,"el":"C"},{"x":1.438,"y":-